// "The Leader" (enemy_1536_ncrmcr): Sovereign (Exhausted Flame summoned on a
// target's tile), Give and Take (sacrificed Flamechaser Soldiers become barriers),
// a revive that releases the wave, and a second form with +30% ATK, a double
// melee strike, two ranged targets and Arson. Her Rebirth aura stays with the
// reviewed talent:Aura contract (enemy-eblana-features.js). Every component
// reachable from the retained abilities, the templates and the three projectiles
// are pinned below with local references reduced to null/local.
